<title>USA: MEAG $191 mln bonds repriced, top yield 5.85 pct.</title>
<headline>MEAG $191 mln bonds repriced, top yield 5.85 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan Securities Inc said Tuesday it repriced Municipal Electric Authority of Georgia's $191 million bond issue, adjusting yields in several maturities but leaving the top yield in 2025 unchanged at 5.85 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
